### ===================================
### SignalTrack API - HTTP Tests
### ===================================
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000


### ===================================
### APP
### ===================================

### Hello endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###


### ===================================
### VEHICLES - CRUD
### ===================================

### Get all vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles

###

### Create a new vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "B-999-TST",
  "driverName": "Test Driver",
  "status": "idle",
  "speed": 0,
  "fuelLevel": 100,
  "lat": 44.4268,
  "lng": 26.1025
}

###

### Create vehicle - moving with speed
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "CJ-55-NEW",
  "driverName": "Maria Test",
  "status": "moving",
  "speed": 85,
  "fuelLevel": 60,
  "lat": 46.7712,
  "lng": 23.6236
}

###

### Get vehicle by ID (replace with actual UUID from create response)
@vehicleId = REPLACE_WITH_VEHICLE_UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}

###

### Update vehicle - change speed and status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "speed": 120,
  "status": "moving"
}

###

### Update vehicle - low fuel alert scenario
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fuelLevel": 8,
  "status": "alert"
}

###

### Delete vehicle
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}

###


### ===================================
### VEHICLES - Validation (expect errors)
### ===================================

### Missing required fields (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "B-000-BAD"
}

###

### Invalid status enum (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "B-111-BAD",
  "driverName": "Bad Status",
  "status": "flying",
  "speed": 0,
  "fuelLevel": 100,
  "lat": 44.4268,
  "lng": 26.1025
}

###

### Fuel over 100 (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "B-222-BAD",
  "driverName": "Bad Fuel",
  "status": "idle",
  "speed": 0,
  "fuelLevel": 150,
  "lat": 44.4268,
  "lng": 26.1025
}

###

### Negative speed (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "B-333-BAD",
  "driverName": "Bad Speed",
  "status": "idle",
  "speed": -10,
  "fuelLevel": 50,
  "lat": 44.4268,
  "lng": 26.1025
}

###

### Non-existent vehicle (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###


### ===================================
### ALERTS
### ===================================

### Get all alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts

###

### Get alerts filtered by vehicleId (query param)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?vehicleId={{vehicleId}}

###

### Get alerts by vehicleId (path param)
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts/{{vehicleId}}

###


### ===================================
### SWAGGER
### ===================================

### Swagger JSON spec
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs-json

###
